# Code owner — @devmattrs is auto-requested for review on every PR.
#
# GitHub never requests review from a PR's own author, so this only routes PRs opened by someone
# else (a teammate or an agent). A pattern that matches nothing is silently dropped.

* @devmattrs

# The standard itself: every consumer repo inherits these on its next re-pin.
/standards/         @devmattrs
/registry/          @devmattrs
/templates/         @devmattrs

# Agent-instruction surface: editing these steers every future agent run in the repo.
/AGENTS.md          @devmattrs
/.cursor/           @devmattrs

# CI and release config.
/.github/           @devmattrs
/midas.toml         @devmattrs
/dist-workspace.toml @devmattrs
